{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/03d89e76cf8051481220c7f56711ce60.poster.avif?t=1765999621\" width=1100 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/03d89e76cf8051481220c7f56711ce60.webm?t=1765999621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/03d89e76cf8051481220c7f56711ce60.mp4?t=1765999621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be the last bot sitting in head to head matches with 2-4 players.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tense PvP matches with 2, 3 or 4 players. Defuse a bomb with your friends and be the last bot sitting to win big! Use emotes, gestures, and in game voice comms to rub it in when their head explodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/61c10889d2c683330088362262ccd4c0.poster.avif?t=1765999621\" width=1100 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/61c10889d2c683330088362262ccd4c0.webm?t=1765999621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/61c10889d2c683330088362262ccd4c0.mp4?t=1765999621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clear wires to get cash, the richest player at the end of the 3 rounds wins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The BombSlot device houses 4 wheels with 8 wires each. On your turn choose and cut one wire. Cutting a wire can earn you cash, abilities or, if your unlucky, detonate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/a03390a4254965b4b3f0063506adf8da.poster.avif?t=1765999621\" width=1100 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/a03390a4254965b4b3f0063506adf8da.webm?t=1765999621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/a03390a4254965b4b3f0063506adf8da.mp4?t=1765999621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use a variety of abilities to gain an edge over chance.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scan</strong> - to narrow down which wires may be detonators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spin</strong>\u00a0- each wheel to a new random position.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skip</strong> - your turn, sometimes its best to let another player cut a suspicious looking wire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reverse</strong> -  the turn order and send it right back to the previous bot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lock</strong> - to limit another players choice to just one wheel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overload</strong> - the bomb to make the next player cut an additional wire (Yes it stacks!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn, Detect, Plant, Obscure, And more!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/86a4de2eda6a81ed31899a52762b80d4.poster.avif?t=1765999621\" width=1100 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea